			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751890401,
					"content": "終於結束了…哼哼，這下我們總算拿到進入那個什麼「聖山之心」的「許可」了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890402,
					"content": "「不，我之前說了，這個只是一個『許可』的空殼載體…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890403,
					"content": "「只是拿著這樣一個鱗片做成的東西，裡面沒有任何持有者的資訊的話，是沒有辦法變成『許可』的。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890404,
					"content": "「不然這東西不就變成『只要是龍就能夠使用』的萬能鑰匙了嗎…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890405,
					"content": "快，押來一條有身分的龍！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751890406,
					"content": "#哪有這樣的龍啦…唔，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是龍，不行嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890407,
					"content": "唔嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890408,
					"content": "「牠…現在還沒有這樣的權能。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890409,
					"content": "那現在怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890410,
					"content": "「在很久之前，在偉大的君主進入聖山之心以後，也有一些具備權力，卻未曾解鎖這一『許可』的傢伙。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890411,
					"content": "「或許，擺放如此顯眼的『許可』其實是為此而留…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				}
			]
		},
